g %@ via Adobe DNG Converter…\u{1}正在通过 Adobe DNG Converter 转换 %@…\u{1}Couldn't build the PMax layer\u{1}无法生成 PMax 图层\u{1}Couldn't export the animation\u{1}无法导出动画\u{1}Couldn't export the image\u{1}无法导出图像\u{1}Couldn't load %@\u{1}无法载入%@\u{1}Couldn't save the project\u{1}无法存储项目\u{1}Crop\u{1}裁剪\u{1}Cropped to %1×%2\u{1}已裁剪为 %1×%2\u{1}Cropped to %1×%2, %3°\u{1}已裁剪为 %1×%2，%3°\u{1}Crop…\u{1}裁剪…\u{1}Custom\u{1}自定\u{1}DMap Result\u{1}DMap 结果\u{1}DMap result (eraser)\u{1}DMap 结果（擦除）\u{1}DNG (raw)\u{1}DNG（原始格式）\u{1}Debloom levels\u{1}去光晕级别\u{1}Depth\u{1}深度\u{1}Depth-map fusion. The only mode with a depth map — needed for the depth view, rocking animation, and depth-aware retouching. Can misjudge where objects at different depths overlap.\u{1}深度图合成。唯一生成深度图的模式——深度视图、摇摆动画和基于深度的修饰都需要它。在不同深度的物体相互重叠处可能判断有误。\u{1}Display P3\u{1}Display P3\u{1}Done Retouching\u{1}完成修饰\u{1}Download\u{1}下载\u{1}Drop a folder of frames here, or:\u{1}将图像文件夹拖放到此处，或：\u{1}Duration:\u{1}时长：\u{1}Edit\u{1}编辑\u{1}Even out exposure\u{1}平衡曝光\u{1}Every fused stack is written to this folder.\u{1}每个已合成的堆栈都会写入此文件夹。\u{1}Exclude and Continue\u{1}排除并继续\u{1}Expand %@\u{1}展开%@\u{1}Export\u{1}导出\u{1}Export Aligned Frames…\u{1}导出已对齐图像…\u{1}Export All Fused…\u{1}导出所有已合成…\u{1}Export Depth Map\u{1}导出深度图\u{1}Export Depth Map…\u{1}导出深度图…\u{1}Export Here\u{1}导出到此处\u{1}Export Result\u{1}导出结果\u{1}Export Result…\u{1}导出结果…\u{1}Export Rocking Animation\u{1}导出摇摆动画\u{1}Export Rocking Animation…\u{1}导出摇摆动画…\u{1}Export aligned frames to a folder\u{1}将对齐后的图像导出到文件夹\u{1}Export every fused stack to a folder\u{1}将所有已合成的堆栈导出到文件夹\u{1}Export finished\u{1}导出完成\u{1}Exposure\u{1}曝光\u{1}Feathered fraction of the brush edge. 0% is hard-edged; 100% fades from the center.\u{1}画笔边缘的羽化比例。0% 为硬边；100% 从中心开始渐隐。\u{1}File\u{1}文件\u{1}Fine-scale focus energy a frame must exceed at a pixel to win the debloom two-track select. Higher is stricter — more of the bloomed frame is rejected in favor of the in-focus one; too high starts rejecting genuinely sharp detail.\u{1}帧在某像素上必须超过的细尺度对焦能量，才能在去光晕的双轨选择中胜出。越高越严格 — 更多带光晕的帧被舍弃，转而采用对焦清晰的帧；过高会开始舍弃真正清晰的细节。\u{1}Finishing\u{1}正在完成\u{1}Fit\u{1}适合窗口\u{1}Focus threshold\u{1}对焦阈值\u{1}Format:\u{1}格式：\u{1}Fraction of the image's overall sharpness below which a pixel is treated as featureless and takes its depth from confident neighbors. Drag to preview the depth map this floor would produce: featureless regions inheriting smoothly from their surroundings is normal — raise the floor until glow halos standing off subjects disappear, and stop before real detail starts dissolving into its neighbors.\u{1}低于图像整体锐度该比例的像素被视为无特征，其深度取自可信的相邻像素。拖动可预览此阈值产生的深度图：无特征区域平滑继承周围深度属正常现象 — 提高阈值直到主体周围的光晕消失，并在真实细节开始溶入周围之前停止。\u{1}Frame Selection\u{1}图像选择\u{1}Frame rate:\u{1}帧率：\u{1}Frames per second. 30 suits sharing; 60 is silkier and larger; 24 is filmic.\u{1}每秒帧数。30 适合分享；60 更顺滑但更大；24 具有电影感。\u{1}Fuse %1 Stacks\u{1}合成 %1 个堆栈\u{1}Fuse %lld Stacks\u{1}合成 %lld 个堆栈\u{1}Fuse 1 Stack\u{1}合成 1 个堆栈\u{1}Fuse Anyway\u{1}仍要合成\u{1}Fuse Stack\u{1}合成堆栈\u{1}Fuse failed\u{1}合成失败\u{1}Fuse on the GPU (identical results, several times faster). Turn off to reduce memory pressure on low-RAM machines, free the GPU for other work, or rule out a driver issue.\u{1}在 GPU 上合成（结果完全相同，速度快数倍）。关闭可减轻低内存机器的内存压力、腾出 GPU 做其他工作，或排查驱动问题。\u{1}Fused — select to view, retouch, or export\u{1}已合成 — 选择以查看、修饰或导出\u{1}Fuses every enabled stack whose result is missing or out of date (frames or settings changed), one after another with the current settings; bad frames are excluded automatically.\u{1}按当前设置依次合成每个已启用但结果缺失或过期（图像或设置已更改）的堆栈；有问题的图像会自动排除。\u{1}Fusion\u{1}合成\u{1}Fusion normally uses a disk cache to improve performance. This stack needs about %@ and the disk has %@ free. Fusion will be slower without a disk cache.\u{1}合成通常使用磁盘缓存来提高性能。此堆栈需要约 %1$@，而磁盘只有 %2$@ 可用。没有磁盘缓存时合成会更慢。\u{1}GIF (loops automatically)\u{1}GIF（自动循环）\u{1}Grant Access\u{1}允许访问\u{1}Grant Access…\u{1}允许访问…\u{1}Grant access to “%@” — %@\u{1}允许访问“%1$@” — %2$@\u{1}Help\u{1}帮助\u{1}Highlights\u{1}高光\u{1}How far the view moves: peak parallax at the depth extremes, as a fraction of the video width (Subtle 0.5%, Medium 1%, Strong 2%).\u{1}视图移动的幅度：深度两端的峰值视差，以视频宽度的比例表示（轻微 0.5%、中等 1%、强烈 2%）。\u{1}How many neighboring frames blend together at each pixel when rendering. Wider is smoother across focus transitions, but slightly softer.\u{1}渲染时每个像素混合多少相邻图像。范围越宽，焦点过渡越平滑，但略微偏软。\u{1}How many of the coarsest pyramid levels are focus-gated to suppress highlight bloom — where an out-of-focus bright halo leaks over a sharp neighbor. 0 turns debloom off (standard PMax, more faithful on stacks without bloom); higher gates more levels, cutting more bloom.\u{1}为抑制高光光晕（失焦的明亮光晕漫过清晰的相邻区域）而对金字塔最粗的若干层按对焦进行门控的层数。0 关闭去光晕（标准 PMax，在无光晕的堆栈上更忠实）；数值越大门控的层数越多，去除的光晕也越多。\u{1}How the viewpoint moves. Rocking sweeps side to side (or up and down); Circle orbits, which reads most strongly 3D — no structure can hide parallel to the motion.\u{1}视点的移动方式。摇摆是左右（或上下）扫动；圆周是环绕运动，立体感最强 — 没有任何结构能与运动方向平行而隐藏。\u{1}Hyperfocal Help\u{1}Hyperfocal 帮助\u{1}Hyperfocal doesn’t have permission to read this project’s images\u{1}Hyperfocal 没有权限读取此项目的图像\u{1}Hyperfocal projects (*.hyperfocal)\u{1}Hyperfocal 项目 (*.hyperfocal)\u{1}Include %@\u{1}包含%@\u{1}Include %@ in Fuse Enabled Stacks\u{1}将%@纳入“合成已启用的堆栈”\u{1}Include this stack in Fuse Enabled Stacks. Doesn't change its per-frame checkboxes.\u{1}将此堆栈纳入“合成已启用的堆栈”。不会更改其中每张图像的勾选状态。\u{1}Includes the Adobe DNG SDK (DNG technology under license by Adobe Systems Incorporated) and the Qt framework under the GNU LGPL v3, plus other open-source libraries. See NOTICE.md for all third-party credits and licenses.\u{1}包含 Adobe DNG SDK（DNG 技术由 Adobe Systems Incorporated 授权）和依据 GNU LGPL v3 授权的 Qt 框架，以及其他开源库。全部第三方致谢与许可信息见 NOTICE.md。\u{1}Input\u{1}输入\u{1}JPEG\u{1}JPEG\u{1}Keep All Frames\u{1}保留所有图像\u{1}Keeps aligned frames in a temporary file during depth fusion so the stack isn't decoded twice (identical results, faster — the file needs about 0.7 GB of free disk per 45-megapixel frame and is removed when fusing finishes). Hyperfocal warns before fusing if it won't fit; turn off to never use the disk.\u{1}在深度合成期间将已对齐图像保存在临时文件中，避免堆栈被解码两次（结果完全相同且更快 — 每张 4500 万像素图像约需 0.7 GB 可用磁盘空间，合成完成后文件即被删除）。若空间不足，Hyperfocal 会在合成前警告；关闭后将完全不使用磁盘。\u{1}Lifts or deepens the shadows without moving pure black — usually the fastest way to inspect a dark fuse.\u{1}提起或加深阴影而不移动纯黑 — 通常是检查偏暗合成结果的最快方式。\u{1}Linear Display P3\u{1}线性 Display P3\u{1}Loading\u{1}载入\u{1}Loading source…\u{1}正在载入来源…\u{1}Low disk space\u{1}磁盘空间不足\u{1}MP4 (H.264)\u{1}MP4（H.264）\u{1}MP4 plays once unless the player is told to loop (no video format carries a loop flag players honor). GIF loops forever everywhere, at the cost of larger files and reduced colors.\u{1}除非播放器设置了循环，MP4 只播放一次（没有任何视频格式带有播放器会遵守的循环标志）。GIF 在任何地方都无限循环，代价是文件更大、颜色更少。\u{1}Matching gradients\u{1}正在匹配梯度\u{1}Measures each frame's overall brightness and corrects shot-to-shot exposure flicker (shutter or lighting variation) before blending, so it can't imprint brightness patches on the result.\u{1}测量每张图像的整体亮度，并在混合前校正逐张曝光闪烁（快门或光照变化），使其无法在结果上留下亮度斑块。\u{1}Median radius\u{1}中值半径\u{1}Medium\u{1}中等\u{1}Moves the black point itself: the very bottom of the range.\u{1}移动黑点本身：范围的最底端。\u{1}Moves the white point itself: the very top of the range.\u{1}移动白点本身：范围的最顶端。\u{1}New Project\u{1}新建项目\u{1}New Project…\u{1}新建项目…\u{1}No Metal device available — fusing runs on the CPU.\u{1}没有可用的 Metal 设备 — 合成将在 CPU 上运行。\u{1}No alignment yet — fuse the stack (with alignment on) first.\u{1}尚未对齐 — 请先（开启对齐）合成堆栈。\u{1}No output yet\u{1}暂无输出\u{1}Noise floor\u{1}噪声阈值\u{1}Non-destructive crop: applies to every export and the rocking animation, and is saved with the project.\u{1}非破坏性裁剪：应用于所有导出和摇摆动画，并随项目一起存储。\u{1}None\u{1}无\u{1}Not Now\u{1}以后再说\u{1}One Stack per Folder\u{1}每个文件夹一个堆栈\u{1}One full cycle of the motion; the file loops seamlessly.\u{1}运动的一个完整周期；文件无缝循环。\u{1}Open Download Page\u{1}打开下载页面\u{1}Open Folder…\u{1}打开文件夹…\u{1}Open Project\u{1}打开项目\u{1}Open Project…\u{1}打开项目…\u{1}Open a different project?\u{1}要打开其他项目吗？\u{1}Open a project\u{1}打开项目\u{1}Open a stack to begin\u{1}打开一个堆栈以开始\u{1}Order frames by capture time\u{1}按拍摄时间排序图像\u{1}Original\u{1}原始比例\u{1}Output\u{1}输出\u{1}Overall brightness, in stops of linear light — the loupe for judging a fuse in deep shadow. Like every Tone control, it applies to the previews (including retouching) and bakes into TIFF/PNG/JPEG exports; Linear DNG is never affected.\u{1}整体亮度，以线性光的档位计 — 是审视深阴影中合成效果的放大镜。与所有色调控制一样，它作用于预览（包括修饰）并烘焙到 TIFF/PNG/JPEG 导出中；线性 DNG 永不受影响。\u{1}PMax Result\u{1}PMax 结果\u{1}PMax blend layer\u{1}PMax 混合图层\u{1}PNG (16-bit)\u{1}PNG（16 位）\u{1}Path:\u{1}路径：\u{1}Performance\u{1}性能\u{1}Preparing the %@ result…\u{1}正在准备 %@ 结果…\u{1}Press “Fuse Stack”\u{1}点按“合成堆栈”\u{1}ProPhoto RGB\u{1}ProPhoto RGB\u{1}Project\u{1}项目\u{1}Pyramid fusion. Clean where depths overlap, but has no depth map (no depth view or rocking) and can bloom highlights, which the Debloom controls reduce.\u{1}金字塔合成。在深度重叠处很干净，但没有深度图（无法使用深度视图或摇摆动画），并且高光可能溢出，可用去光晕控件减轻。\u{1}Quit\u{1}退出\u{1}Radius of the local-contrast measurement that decides which frame is sharpest at each pixel. Larger values are steadier on smooth, low-texture surfaces; smaller values resolve finer depth detail.\u{1}用于判定每个像素处哪张图像最清晰的局部对比度测量半径。较大的值在平滑、低纹理表面上更稳定；较小的值能分辨更精细的深度细节。\u{1}Reading frames\u{1}正在读取图像\u{1}Redo\u{1}重做\u{1}Redo %@\u{1}重做%@\u{1}Redo Stroke\u{1}重做笔画\u{1}Register every frame to its neighbor before fusing (focus breathing, drift, rotation). Turn off only for stacks that are already pixel-aligned, e.g. re-exports from another tool.\u{1}合成前将每张图像与相邻图像配准（焦点呼吸、漂移、旋转）。仅对已像素级对齐的堆栈关闭，例如从其他工具重新导出的堆栈。\u{1}Regularizing depth map\u{1}正在正则化深度图\u{1}Rendering\u{1}正在渲染\u{1}Reset\u{1}重置\u{1}Restoring project…\u{1}正在恢复项目…\u{1}Result\u{1}结果\u{1}Retouch from\u{1}修饰来源\u{1}Retouched Depth\u{1}修饰后的深度\u{1}Retouched Depth — drag to paint from source\u{1}修饰后的深度 — 拖动以从来源绘制\u{1}Retouched Output — drag to paint from source\u{1}修饰后的输出 — 拖动以从来源绘制\u{1}Retouching\u{1}修饰\u{1}Revert All\u{1}全部还原\u{1}Rock left–right\u{1}左右摇摆\u{1}Rock up–down\u{1}上下摇摆\u{1}Rocking animations export as GIF on this platform — choose a .gif filename.\u{1}在此平台上，摇摆动画将导出为 GIF，请选择 .gif 文件名。\u{1}S-curve around the midtones: positive deepens shadows and brightens highlights, negative flattens.\u{1}围绕中间调的 S 曲线：正值加深阴影、提亮高光，负值使影调变平。\u{1}Save Project\u{1}存储项目\u{1}Save Project As…\u{1}项目存储为…\u{1}Save project\u{1}存储项目\u{1}Scanning frames…\u{1}正在扫描图像…\u{1}Select a frame in the Stack list\u{1}在堆栈列表中选择一张图像\u{1}Separate Stacks\u{1}独立堆栈\u{1}Settings\u{1}设置\u{1}Settings…\u{1}设置…\u{1}Shadows\u{1}阴影\u{1}Sharpness σ\u{1}锐度 σ\u{1}Size of the majority vote that removes isolated wrong-depth patches at edges where the background shows through a defocused subject. 0 disables it.\u{1}多数表决的范围大小，用于去除背景透过失焦主体显现的边缘处孤立的错误深度斑块。0 表示停用。\u{1}Skip\u{1}跳过\u{1}Softness\u{1}柔和度\u{1}Some stacks didn't fuse\u{1}部分堆栈未能合成\u{1}Sorts each stack's frames by EXIF capture time when loading (filename order breaks when the camera's file counter rolls over mid-stack). Frames without timestamps fall back to filename order. Turn off to always order by filename.\u{1}载入时按 EXIF 拍摄时间排序每个堆栈的图像（相机文件计数器在堆栈中途归零时，文件名顺序会出错）。没有时间戳的图像回退到文件名顺序。关闭后始终按文件名排序。\u{1}Source Image\u{1}源图像\u{1}Source: %1   ↑/↓ cycle · space picks sharpest\u{1}来源：%1   ↑/↓ 切换 · 空格选择最清晰的图像\u{1}Source: %@  ↑/↓ cycle · space picks sharpest\u{1}来源：%@  ↑/↓ 切换 · 空格选取最清晰\u{1}Stack\u{1}堆栈\u{1}Stack %@\u{1}堆栈%@\u{1}Stack %lld of %lld · \u{1}堆栈 %1$lld / %2$lld · \u{1}Stack section\u{1}堆栈部分\u{1}Stacks\u{1}堆栈\u{1}Start Retouching\u{1}开始修饰\u{1}Start a new project to begin\u{1}新建项目以开始\u{1}Start a new project?\u{1}要新建项目吗？\u{1}Starting…\u{1}正在开始…\u{1}Stop building the PMax layer and go back to the previous brush source. Selecting PMax Result again restarts the build.\u{1}停止生成 PMax 图层并返回上一个画笔来源。再次选择 PMax 结果会重新开始生成。\u{1}Strength:\u{1}强度：\u{1}Strong\u{1}强烈\u{1}Subtle\u{1}轻微\u{1}Swap Crop Orientation\u{1}切换裁剪方向\u{1}Swap the crop between landscape and portrait (X).\u{1}在横向与纵向之间切换裁剪（X）。\u{1}TIFF (16-bit)\u{1}TIFF（16 位）\u{1}That folder doesn’t contain the project’s images\u{1}该文件夹不包含此项目的图像\u{1}The images are in “%@”. Choose that folder, or any folder that contains it.\u{1}图像位于“%@”。请选择该文件夹或包含它的任意文件夹。\u{1}The pipeline works in Display P3. sRGB is the safe default for sharing; Display P3 keeps the full working gamut; ProPhoto suits further heavy editing. DNG always carries the full P3 gamut as linear raw.\u{1}处理管线在 Display P3 中工作。sRGB 是分享的稳妥默认；Display P3 保留完整工作色域；ProPhoto 适合后续深度编辑。DNG 始终以线性原始格式携带完整 P3 色域。\u{1}The selected frames are written to this folder, aligned to the fused canvas.\u{1}所选图像将写入此文件夹，并与合成画布对齐。\u{1}These frames carry no capture times, so they fuse in filename order. Make sure filenames follow focus order.\u{1}这些图像没有拍摄时间，因此按文件名顺序合成。请确保文件名遵循对焦顺序。\u{1}This image cannot be previewed\u{1}无法预览此图像\u{1}Tone\u{1}色调\u{1}Tone Adjustment\u{1}色调调整\u{1}Try Again\u{1}重试\u{1}Undo\u{1}撤销\u{1}Undo %@\u{1}撤销%@\u{1}Undo Stroke\u{1}撤销笔画\u{1}Unsaved data will be lost.\u{1}未存储的数据将丢失。\u{1}Use GPU\u{1}使用 GPU\u{1}Version %1 (%2)\u{1}版本 %1 (%2)\u{1}Waiting for the previous fusion to stop…\u{1}正在等待上一次合成停止…\u{1}What the brush paints from. Source Image: any aligned frame (↑/↓ to pick, space for the sharpest under the brush). PMax Result: a pyramid fusion of the whole stack — where structures at different depths overlap, the depth map has to pick one side, and this layer keeps both; built on first use, then cached. DMap Result: the untouched fusion — an eraser that restores it exactly where a stroke overreached, without undoing everything since.\u{1}画笔的绘制来源。源图像：任意已对齐图像（↑/↓ 选择，空格选画笔下最清晰的）。PMax 结果：整个堆栈的金字塔合成 — 不同深度的结构重叠处，深度图只能取其一，而该图层两者都保留；首次使用时生成，之后缓存。DMap 结果：未经修饰的合成 — 一块橡皮，只在笔画越界处精确还原，而不撤销之后的所有操作。\u{1}Whites\u{1}白色\u{1}Writes a short video that rocks the result left and right using the depth map for parallax — depth becomes visible motion. Strength is chosen in the save dialog.\u{1}写出一段短视频，利用深度图产生视差让结果左右摇摆 — 深度变为可见的运动。强度在存储对话框中选择。\u{1}Writes every fused stack (retouch edits included) to one folder, named after the stacks, in the format and color space chosen in the dialog.\u{1}将每个已合成的堆栈（含修饰编辑）写入一个文件夹，以堆栈命名，采用对话框中选择的格式和色彩空间。\u{1}Zoom In\u{1}放大\u{1}Zoom Out\u{1}缩小\u{1}Zoom in\u{1}放大\u{1}Zoom level\u{1}缩放级别\u{1}Zoom out\u{1}缩小\u{1}Zoom to Fit\u{1}缩放以适合窗口\u{1}Zoom:\u{1}缩放：\u{1}alignment failed\u{1}对齐失败\u{1}macOS grants access folder by folder, and the permission this project saved couldn’t be restored. Grant access to %@ to load the images — saving the project afterward keeps the access for next time. Fused results are intact either way.\u{1}macOS 按文件夹授予访问权限，而此项目存储的权限无法恢复。请允许访问%@以载入图像 — 之后存储项目即可在下次保留该权限。无论如何，已合成的结果都完好无损。\u{1}misaligned (%.1f× the stack's typical frame difference)\u{1}未对齐（为堆栈典型帧差的 %.1f 倍）\u{1}project restore failed: %@\u{1}项目恢复失败：%@\u{1}sRGB\u{1}sRGB\u{1}the folder “%@”\u{1}文件夹“%@”\u{1}~%lld min left\u{1}剩余约 %lld 分钟\u{1}~%llds left\u{1}剩余约 %lld 秒\u{1}“%@” looks like %lld separate stacks\u{1}“%1$@”看起来像 %2$lld 个独立堆栈\u{1}↑/↓ cycle source frames · space picks the sharpest frame for the brush region · p PMax result · r eraser · ⌥-scroll or [ ] resize the brush · scroll/pinch to navigate\u{1}↑/↓ 切换源图像 · 空格键选取画笔区域最清晰的图像 · p PMax 结果 · r 擦除 · ⌥-滚动或 [ ] 调整画笔大小 · 滚动/捏合以导航"
